<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Complaint Management System' }) %>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Raise it. Track it. Get it resolved.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    A single place to submit complaints to the college administration —
    academics, infrastructure, hostel, IT, and more — and follow their
    progress through to resolution.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="/register" class="btn">Register as a Student</a>
    <a href="/login">Already have an account? Log in</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="hero-grid">
  <div class="hero-card">
    <h3>Submit</h3>
    <p>Pick a category, describe the issue, and attach a photo or document if it helps.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-card">
    <h3>Track</h3>
    <p>Every complaint moves through Submitted, Under Review, In Progress, and Resolved.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-card">
    <h3>Hear back</h3>
    <p>Administrators respond directly on your complaint, so you always know where things stand.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="admin-link">Administrator? <a href="/admin/login">Log in here</a>.</p>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>